    "preamble": "Lakhan Chakraverti vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 4 June, 2015 Crr-1181-2015 (Lakhan Chakraverti Vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh) 04-06-2015 Shri Ashok Chakravarti, learned counsel for the applicant. Shri Amit Seth, learned Govt. Advocate for the respondent/State.",
    "facts": "Also heard on I.A. No.10624/2015, which is an application for suspension of jail sentence and grant of bail to appellant. The appellant has been convicted under Sections 7(1) read with Section 16(1)(A)(i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act and has been sentenced to undergo RI for six months and fine of Rs. 1,000/- with default stipulations. Learned counsel for the applicant submits that applicant has been falsely implicated in this case.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the State has opposed the prayer for bail.",
